SCOPE - PLEASE READ

The MIT licence above covers the *code* in this repository: the analysis
pipeline in pipeline/ and the page it builds.

It does NOT cover:

  * The derived data in data/ - the CSVs, the GeoJSON layers and summary.json.
    Those are licensed Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International, which
    requires attribution. See LICENSE-DATA.md.

  * Third-party material this work is built on and does not own: the Earth Index
    mining detections (Earth Genome), the administrative boundaries
    (geoBoundaries, CC BY 4.0), the bundled Geist typefaces (Vercel, SIL Open
    Font License 1.1, see pipeline/fonts/OFL.txt), the satellite imagery shown
    in the map (Esri or Mapbox, per their terms), and any WDPA protected-areas
    extract, which UNEP-WCMC do not permit to be redistributed at all.

LICENSE-DATA.md sets out each of these.
